    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life Inside\u00a0</strong>is a <strong>short story-driven point-and-click adventure game</strong>.<br>Set on a planet where the protagonist has crash-landed, the player must find a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to be enjoyed <strong>entirely with simple mouse clicks</strong>\u2014no other controls are needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single playthrough takes about <strong>30 to 60 minutes</strong>, with 3<strong>\u00a0different endings</strong> to discover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short yet unique experience</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for tools and escape</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-style graphics with melancholic music</strong></p></li></ul>",
